              </div>
              <div class="action-item">
                <span class="action-icon">📦</span>
                <span><span class="institution-label" style="background:#e6f4ea;color:#1a7a3d;">国家能源局</span>数据显示3月全社会用电量同比+3.5%，季末冲高后回归常态，全年增速预计5%+</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-box module-tips">
